  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1e293b] to-[#0f172a] p-10 sm:p-14 text-center shadow-2xl">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Have a serious web platform to build?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-[#94a3b8]">Start a conversation about architecture, admin systems, publishing platforms, developer tools, or performance-focused full-stack work.</p>
      <a href="mailto:talk@kabirmahmud.xyz" class="btn-primary mt-8 text-base inline-flex">
